#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Mga bersyon ng package\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang code sa pahinang ito ay ginawa gamit ang mga sumusunod na kinakailangan.\n"
"Inirerekomenda naming gamitin ang mga bersyong ito o mas bago.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Para mapadali ang pagbuo at muling paggamit ng custom na transpilation code ng mas malawak na komunidad ng mga gumagamit ng Qiskit, sinusuportahan ng Qiskit SDK ang isang plugin interface na nagbibigay-daan sa mga third-party na Python package na ideklara na nagbibigay sila ng pinalawak na transpilation functionality na naa-access sa pamamagitan ng Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation "
"functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa kasalukuyan, ang mga third-party na plugin ay maaaring magbigay ng "
"pinalawak na transpilation functionality sa tatlong paraan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [transpiler stage "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides"
" a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 "
"stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, "
"`layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang [transpiler stage "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) ay "
"nagbibigay ng pass manager na maaaring gamitin kapalit ng isa sa [6 na "
"yugto](transpiler-stages) ng preset staged pass manager: `init`, `layout`, "
"`routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, at `scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [unitary synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang [unitary synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin)"
" ay nagbibigay ng pinalawak na functionality para sa unitary gate "
"synthesis.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A [high-level synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" "
"such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are "
"represented by subclasses of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang isang [high-level synthesis "
"plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin)"
" ay nagbibigay ng pinalawak na functionality para sa pag-synthesize ng mga "
"\"high-level object\" tulad ng mga linear function o Clifford operator. Ang "
"mga high-level object ay kinakatawan ng mga subclass ng klase na "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new "
"ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng natitirang bahagi ng pahina kung paano ilista ang mga "
"available na plugin, mag-install ng mga bago, at gamitin ang mga ito.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-"
"install-new-ones}"
msgstr ""
"Ilista ang mga available na plugin at mag-install ng mga bago {#list-"
"available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install "
"more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run "
"`pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit "
"TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A "
"number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kasama na sa Qiskit ang ilang built-in na plugin para sa transpilation. Para"
" mag-install ng higit pa, maaari mong gamitin ang iyong Python package "
"manager. Halimbawa, maaari kang magpatakbo ng `pip install qiskit-toqm` para"
" i-install ang [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) "
"routing stage plugin. Ang ilang third-party na plugin ay bahagi ng [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Ilista ang mga available na transpiler stage plugin {#list-available-"
"transpiler-stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins)"
" function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang function na "
"[list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins),"
" at ipasa ang pangalan ng yugto na ang mga plugin ay gusto mong ilista.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of "
"`routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
" Kung naka-install ang `qiskit-toqm`, lilitaw ang `toqm` sa listahan ng mga "
"`routing` plugin.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-"
"plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Ilista ang mga available na unitary synthesis plugin {#list-available-"
"unitary-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang function na "
"[unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-"
"synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr ""
"Ilista ang mga available na high-level synthesis plugin {#list-available-"
"high-level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names)"
" function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be "
"synthesized. The name corresponds to the "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)"
" attribute of the "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang function na "
"[high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names),"
" na ipinapasa ang pangalan ng uri ng \"high-level object\" na isi-"
"synthesize. Ang pangalan ay tumutugma sa attribute na "
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name)"
" ng klase na "
"[Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation)"
" na kumakatawan sa uri ng object na isi-synthesize.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang klase na "
"[HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager)"
" para ilista ang mga pangalan ng lahat ng high-level synthesis plugin:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Gumamit ng plugin {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code "
"examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from "
"third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa seksyong ito, ipinapakita namin kung paano gamitin ang mga transpiler "
"plugin. Sa mga halimbawa ng code, gumagamit kami ng mga plugin na kasama ng "
"Qiskit, ngunit ang mga plugin na naka-install mula sa mga third-party na "
"package ay ginagamit sa parehong paraan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr "Gumamit ng transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate "
"argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the "
"transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we "
"would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para gumamit ng transpiler stage plugin, tukuyin ang pangalan nito gamit ang"
" naaangkop na argument sa "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" o "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Ang argument ay nabubuo sa pamamagitan ng pagdaragdag ng `_method` sa "
"pangalan ng transpilation stage. Halimbawa, para gamitin ang `lookahead` "
"routing plugin, titukuyin natin ang `lookahead` para sa argument na "
"`routing_method`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang mock backend na `FakeSherbrooke` mula sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` ay ginagamit sa mga halimbawang ito, ngunit maaari mo itong subukan sa anumang Qiskit-compatible na tunay o pekeng backend.  Maaaring magkaiba ang iyong mga resulta.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Gumamit ng unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the "
"`unitary_synthesis_method` argument to "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Para gumamit ng unitary synthesis plugin, tukuyin ang pangalan nito bilang "
"argument na `unitary_synthesis_method` sa "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" o "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` "
"stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagamit ang unitary synthesis sa mga yugtong `init`, `translation`, at "
"`optimization` ng staged pass manager na ibinalik ng "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" o ginagamit sa "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Tingnan ang [Mga yugto ng Transpiler](transpiler-stages) para sa "
"paglalarawan ng mga yugtong ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, "
"to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the "
"synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this "
"list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary "
"synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang argument na `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, isang free-form "
"na dictionary, para ipasa ang mga opsyon para sa unitary synthesis method. "
"Dapat ipaliwanag ng dokumentasyon ng synthesis method ang mga opsyong "
"sinusuportahan nito. Tingnan ang [listahang "
"ito](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-"
"synthesis-plugins-2) para sa mga link sa dokumentasyon ng mga built-in na "
"unitary synthesis plugin.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr ""
"Gumamit ng high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, gumawa ng [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) para\n"
"itago ang mga pangalan ng mga plugin na gagamitin para sa iba't ibang high-level object. Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang code cell na ito ay gumagawa ng high-level synthesis configuration na gumagamit ng `layers` plugin\n"
"para sa pag-synthesize ng mga object na [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) at ng `pmh` plugin para sa pag-synthesize ng\n"
"mga object na [LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction). Ang mga pangalan ng keyword argument ay tumutugma sa\n"
"attribute na [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) ng klase na [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) na kumakatawan sa uri ng object na isi-synthesize.\n"
"Para sa bawat high-level object, ang listahan ng mga ibinigay na plugin ay sinusubukan nang sunud-sunod hanggang sa magtagumpay ang isa sa kanila\n"
"(sa halimbawa sa itaas, ang bawat listahan ay naglalaman lamang ng isang plugin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bukod sa pagtukoy ng\n"
"plugin sa pamamagitan ng pangalan nito, maaari ka ring magpasa ng tuple na `(name, options)`, kung saan ang pangalawang elemento ng tuple ay isang dictionary na naglalaman ng mga opsyon para sa plugin. Dapat ipaliwanag ng dokumentasyon ng synthesis method ang mga opsyong sinusuportahan nito. Tingnan ang [listahang ito](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) para sa mga link sa dokumentasyon ng mga built-in na high-level synthesis plugin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Kapag nagawa mo na ang object na `HLSConfig`, ipasa ito bilang\n"
"argument na `hls_config` sa [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and "
"`optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" or used in "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these "
"stages.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ginagamit ang high-level synthesis sa mga yugtong `init`, `translation`, at "
"`optimization` ng staged pass manager na ibinalik ng "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" o ginagamit sa "
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile)."
" Tingnan ang [Mga yugto ng Transpiler](transpiler-stages) para sa "
"paglalarawan ng mga yugtong ito.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendation\">\n"
"- [Create a transpiler plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Check out the [tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) for examples of transpiling and running quantum circuits.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- [Gumawa ng transpiler plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Tingnan ang mga [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) para sa mga halimbawa ng pag-transpile at pagpapatakbo ng mga quantum circuit.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
